 (text "microSD 4-bit interface: RK3568 SDMMC0, TFP09-2-12B push-push socket with card detect." (at 30 20 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003000"))
(text "SDMMC0 data/CMD/CLK: 22R series at SoC side; ESD5341N 0.6pF protection at socket side." (at 30 30 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003001"))
(text "Card detect: 100R series, 10k pull-up to VCCIO_SD; switch closes to GND when card inserted." (at 30 40 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003002"))
(text "Card VDD is fixed 3.3V (VCC3V3_SD); RK3568 VCCIO3 is VCCIO_SD from RK809 LDO5 and switches 3.3V/1.8V for UHS-I." (at 30 50 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003003"))
(text "SDMMC0_PWREN intentionally NC; card VDD is directly supplied through R57=0R from VCC3V3_SYS." (at 30 60 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003004"))
(text "J4 TFP09-2-12B: LCSC C2911421 / JLC assembly extended C2887880; verify current supply before order." (at 30 278 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af000000-0000-4000-8000-000000003005"))
